    "body": "This lands only `docs/research/tiered-eval-2026-10-05.md` from #1733. The rest of #1733's branch, the v1 instrument commits, is already on main via #1740, so retargeting #1733 conflicted on stale copies.\n\nThe document records the v1 finding: tier C did not beat the 'I'm not sure' constant. That finding led to the v3 instrument (exact memory checks, per-category constant controls), whose results are in #1740.\n\nThe claim-wording check passes, and the change is documentation only.\n\nReferences #820\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
